  {
   "id": 3,
   "ref": "540–543",
   "en": "But, even if I wanted to, who would let me? Who would take a woman they despise aboard their proud ships? Don't you know, alas, lost woman? Don't you see yet the broken oaths of Laomedon's race? What then? Should I run off alone, and join their crews as they sail away rejoicing?",
